        "text": "# Paper and Ink\n\n**Author:** \n\n**Published:** 2026-09-14\n\n**Categories:** \n\n**Tags:** \n\n**Source:** https://blog.billymacdeus.com/\n\n---\n\nInk overflowing on a pen, bleeding\nBlue taints on white paper, spreading\nUncontrollably on its surface, soaking\nInevitably as if a rape, is happening\nfrom the ink uniting in to the whiteness of the paper\nMy hand smudged\nI rubbed it to erase the ink\nAll the more it expanded\nExtending, further, blotching\nMy skin\n-Mac\n",
